   "fields": [
    {
     "packet": 2,
     "field": "dns.count.answers",
     "value": "2"
    },
    {
     "packet": 2,
     "field": "dns.a",
     "value": "1.2.3.4,5.6.7.8"
    }
   ],
   "notes": [
    "T-DNS-15【D-DNS-1补遗】：RFC 1035 §4.1.2多RR；tshark同名字段逗号聚合（落盘实测1.2.3.4,5.6.7.8）；包1查询包无answers计0"
   ]
  }
 },
 {
